\f0\fs22\b MusicForge\b0\f1\fs20\par
\par
MusicForge is a music player built on the AudioForge sound engine - a full\par
digital audio workstation in a single application.\par
\par
\b What is inside\b0\par
\'95 31-band graphic equaliser with minimum- and linear-phase modes\par
\'95 Real-time spectrum, waveform and spectrogram visualisers\par
\'95 Internet radio with thousands of stations\par
\'95 Network speaker output - stream to speakers around your home\par
\'95 Per-device output selection; follows Windows default automatically\par
\'95 Themeable interface with multiple presets\par
\'95 Lossless-format library management, playlists and smart search\par
\par
MusicForge installs to your chosen folder, adds a Start menu entry and\par
optionally a desktop shortcut. No account, no telemetry - your music\par
stays on your machine.\par
